{"_attachments":{},"_id":"@halofe/global-locale","_rev":"1893388-620cab2958f2a75121c633e3","description":"locale information manager","dist-tags":{"beta":"1.0.3-alpha.3","latest":"1.0.3"},"license":"ISC","maintainers":[{"name":"doub","email":"doub7boss@163.com"},{"name":"lynsun","email":"814253326@qq.com"},{"name":"leanhunter","email":"heww@live.cn"},{"name":"lllang","email":"smal_wave@163.com"},{"name":"mozheng-neal","email":"m13710224694@163.com"},{"name":"danger7","email":"danger7boss@gmail.com"},{"name":"aliretail","email":"dengce.dc@alibaba-inc.com"},{"name":"fitzchen","email":"alancheen06@gmail.com"},{"name":"jl_raining","email":"JL_raining@163.com"}],"name":"@halofe/global-locale","readme":"## @halofe/global-locale\n\n### 主要特征\n\n- 提供获取和设置地区/语言/货币/时区等 locale 信息能力\n- 遵循[国际化开发规约](https://yuque.antfin.com/ioc-doc/must-doc)\n- 抹平不同容器(web/weex/windVane/小程序)之间的差异\n\n### 安装\n\n```\ntnpm install @halofe/global-locale --save\n```\n\n### API\n\n#### getLocale\n\n获取当前 locale 信息\n\n```js\nimport locale from \"@halofe/global-locale\";\n\nconst { region, lang, currency, tz } = locale.getLocale();\n\nconsole.log(region, lang, currency, tz); // CN, zh-CN, CNY, Asia/Shanghai\n```\n\n注意: 所有的 locale 信息的 set 操作, 在 web 环境下生效, weex 和 windVane 跟随应用的设置.\n\n#### setRegion\n\n> locale cookie 存储默认 domain 为 location.hostname, path 为'/', 时间为一个月\n\n设置地区, 地区编码见[https://yuque.antfin.com/ioc-1/specification/region](https://yuque.antfin.com/ioc-1/specification/region)\n\n```js\nimport locale from \"@halofe/global-locale\";\nlocale.setRegion(\"CN\");\n```\n\n#### setLang\n\n设置语言, 语言编码见[https://yuque.antfin.com/ioc-1/specification/language](https://yuque.antfin.com/ioc-1/specification/language)\n\n```js\nimport locale from \"@halofe/global-locale\";\nlocale.setLang(\"zh-CN\");\n```\n\n#### setCurrency\n\n设置货币, 货币编码见[https://yuque.antfin.com/ioc-1/specification/currency](https://yuque.antfin.com/ioc-1/specification/currency)\n\n```js\nimport locale from \"@halofe/global-locale\";\nlocale.setCurrency(\"CNY\");\n```\n\n#### setTimeZone\n\n设置时区, 时区编码见[https://yuque.antfin.com/ioc-1/specification/time-zone](https://yuque.antfin.com/ioc-1/specification/time-zone)\n\n````\n```js\nimport locale from '@halofe/global-locale';\nlocale.setTimeZone('CNY');\n````\n\n#### setLocale\n\n设置自定义的 locale 信息\n\n```js\nimport locale from \"@halofe/global-locale\";\nlocale.setLocale(\"site\", \"rus\");\n\nconst localeInfo = locale.getLocale();\nconsole.log(localeInfo.site); // rus\n```\n\n#### 提供标准的 cookie 读写函数\n\n```js\nimport { Cookie } from '@halofe/global-locale';\n\n/**\n * 获取 cookie 的值\n * @param {string} key , the key of cookie , if not set, will return all the cookie\n */\nCookie.get('x-hng')  ==> //region=CN&lang=zh-CN&currency=CNY\n\n/**\n * 设置 cookie 的值\n * @param {string} key\n * @param {string} value\n * @param {object} attributes\n */\nCookie.set('x-hng','region=CN&lang=zh-CN&currency=CNY', {\n  maxAge: 24*30*60*60, //最好设置 cookie 的过期时间, 不然 cookie 的过期时间就是 session 时间, 也就是关闭窗口的时间\n  path: '/', // domain 为当前页面 domain\n})\n\n/**\n * 移除 cookie\n * @param {string} key\n */\nCookie.remove('x-hng')\n\n```\n\n### 自定义 Locale 信息,\n\n我们提供用户自定义的方式来处理 locale 信息.\n\n```js\nconst myLocale = locale.create({\n  key: \"my-name\", // lolale 存储的 cookie 的 key 或者 在 windvane / weex 等环境下 locale 存放的位置, 默认为 x-hng\n  domain: \".lazada.vn\", // cookie domain, 默认为  location.hostname\n  path: \"/\", // cookie path, 默认为'/',\n  maxAge: 30 * 24 * 60 * 60, // cookie 过期时间, 秒为单位, 默认时长为 180 天.\n});\n```\n","time":{"created":"2022-02-16T07:43:37.417Z","modified":"2022-02-16T08:03:48.257Z","1.0.3-alpha.2":"2022-02-16T07:43:24.238Z","1.0.3-alpha.3":"2022-02-16T07:46:08.897Z","1.0.3":"2022-02-16T08:03:36.074Z"},"versions":{"1.0.3-alpha.2":{"name":"@halofe/global-locale","version":"1.0.3-alpha.2","description":"locale information manager","main":"lib/index.js","scripts":{"type-check":"tsc --noEmit","type-check:watch":"npm run type-check -- --watch","build":"npm run build:types && npm run build:js","build:typ